window.BIZDAVAR_ARTICLE_BODIES = {"what-is-digital-marketing":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-def\">تعریف عملی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-channels\">کانال‌ها</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-vs\">تفاوت با بازاریابی سنتی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-start\">از کجا شروع کنیم</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>دیجیتال مارکتینگ</li><li>سئو</li><li>SMM</li><li>CRO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>دیجیتال مارکتینگ یعنی رساندن پیام درست به مخاطب درست در کانال آنلاین — وبسایت، جستجو، شبکه اجتماعی، تبلیغات و ایمیل — تا آگاهی، اعتماد و در نهایت فروش ساخته شود. در <a href=\"/pages/about\">بیزدوار گروپ</a> این کار را جدا از «پست گذاشتن» می‌بینیم: قیف، سنجش و اتصال به <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">خدمات بازاریابی دیجیتال</a>.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/network-map.svg\" alt=\"نقشه کانال‌های دیجیتال مارکتینگ برای کسب‌وکار B2B\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>کانال‌ها باید به یک تماس یا استعلام ختم شوند — نه فقط بازدید.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-def\">تعریف عملی</h2>\n<p>تعریف دانشگاهی کافی نیست. تعریف عملی ما این است: هر فعالیت قابل اندازه‌گیری که هزینه جذب مشتری را کم و نرخ تبدیل را زیاد کند. اگر کمپین بازدید می‌آورد اما واتساپ ساکت است، مارکتینگ کامل نیست.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-channels\">کانال‌های اصلی</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>سئو و محتوا:</strong> مقاله و صفحه خدمت برای کوئری‌هایی مثل «دیجیتال مارکتینگ چیست» — همین وبلاگ بخشی از همان مسیر است.</li>\n<li><strong>تبلیغات جستجو:</strong> بودجه کنترل‌شده روی کوئری با نیت خرید.</li>\n<li><strong>SMM:</strong> حضور منظم در اینستاگرام و لینکدین؛ جزئیات در <a href=\"/pages/articles/social-media-management\">راهنمای SMM</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>وبسایت:</strong> اگر لندینگ کند یا بدون RTL باشد، بقیه کانال‌ها هدر می‌رود — <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> برای شروع ۵روزه.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ch-vs\">تفاوت با بازاریابی سنتی</h2>\n<p>در دیجیتال می‌توان CTR، CPA و نرخ پاسخ را هفتگی دید و بودجه را جابه‌جا کرد. راهنمای پایه گوگل برای شروع فنی: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SEO Starter Guide</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-start\">از کجا شروع کنیم؟</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>یک صفحه خدمت شفاف با فراخوان واتساپ/فرم.</li>\n<li>دو یا سه مقاله خوشه‌ای که به همان صفحه لینک بدهند.</li>\n<li>بودجه آزمایشی تبلیغ فقط بعد از اندازه‌گیری تبدیل.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>ادامه عملی را در <a href=\"/pages/articles/digital-marketing\">چگونه بازاریابی دیجیتال فروش را افزایش می‌دهد</a> بخوانید یا از <a href=\"/pages/contact\">فرم تماس</a> مشاوره بگیرید.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>دیجیتال مارکتینگ فقط اینستاگرام است؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">خیر. وبسایت، سئو، تبلیغات جستجو، ایمیل و SMM با هم قیف فروش را می‌سازند.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>برای کسب‌وکار B2B صنعتی هم لازم است؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">بله. خریدار صنعتی هم جستجو می‌کند؛ صفحه محصول، مقاله تخصصی و واتساپ مسیر استعلام را کوتاه می‌کند.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-def\">Tanım</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-channels\">Kanallar</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-vs\">Geleneksel pazarlama</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-start\">Nereden başlamalı</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>Dijital pazarlama</li><li>SEO</li><li>SMM</li><li>CRO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Dijital pazarlama, doğru kitleye çevrimiçi ulaşmaktır the right audience online — site, search, social, ads and email — to build awareness, trust and sales. <a href=\"/pages/about\">Bizdavar Group</a> bünyesinde it is not “posting”; it is funnel, measurement and <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">digital marketing services</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/network-map.svg\" alt=\"Map of digital marketing channels for a B2B company\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Every channel should end in a call or quote — not vanity traffic.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-def\">A working definition</h2><p>If a campaign brings visits but WhatsApp stays quiet, marketing is incomplete. We measure cost per lead and conversion, not likes.</p><h2 id=\"ch-channels\">Main channels</h2><ul><li><strong>SEO and content</strong> — including this blog cluster.</li><li><strong>Search ads</strong> — controlled spend on buyer-intent queries.</li><li><strong>SMM</strong> — see the <a href=\"/pages/articles/social-media-management\">SMM guide</a>.</li><li><strong>Website</strong> — start fast with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</li></ul><h2 id=\"ch-vs\">Vs traditional</h2><p>You can move budget weekly. Technical primer: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SEO Starter Guide</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-start\">Where to start</h2><ol><li>One clear service page with WhatsApp/form.</li><li>Two or three cluster articles linking to it.</li><li>Test ads only after conversion tracking.</li></ol><p>Next: <a href=\"/pages/articles/digital-marketing\">how digital marketing increases sales</a> or <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Dijital pazarlama yalnızca Instagram mı?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Hayır. Site, SEO, arama reklamı, e-posta ve SMM birlikte satış hunisini kurar.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>B2B sanayi için de gerekir mi?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Evet. Alıcı da arama yapar; ürün sayfası ve WhatsApp teklifi hızlandırır.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-def\">Definition</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-channels\">Channels</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-vs\">Vs traditional</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-start\">Where to start</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>Digital marketing</li><li>SEO</li><li>SMM</li><li>CRO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Digital marketing is reaching the right audience online — site, search, social, ads and email — to build awareness, trust and sales. At <a href=\"/pages/about\">Bizdavar Group</a> it is not “posting”; it is funnel, measurement and <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">digital marketing services</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/network-map.svg\" alt=\"Map of digital marketing channels for a B2B company\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Every channel should end in a call or quote — not vanity traffic.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-def\">A working definition</h2><p>If a campaign brings visits but WhatsApp stays quiet, marketing is incomplete. We measure cost per lead and conversion, not likes.</p><h2 id=\"ch-channels\">Main channels</h2><ul><li><strong>SEO and content</strong> — including this blog cluster.</li><li><strong>Search ads</strong> — controlled spend on buyer-intent queries.</li><li><strong>SMM</strong> — see the <a href=\"/pages/articles/social-media-management\">SMM guide</a>.</li><li><strong>Website</strong> — start fast with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</li></ul><h2 id=\"ch-vs\">Vs traditional</h2><p>You can move budget weekly. Technical primer: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SEO Starter Guide</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-start\">Where to start</h2><ol><li>One clear service page with WhatsApp/form.</li><li>Two or three cluster articles linking to it.</li><li>Test ads only after conversion tracking.</li></ol><p>Next: <a href=\"/pages/articles/digital-marketing\">how digital marketing increases sales</a> or <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Is digital marketing only Instagram?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">No. Website, SEO, search ads, email and SMM together build the sales funnel.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Does B2B industry need it?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Yes. Buyers still search; a product page plus WhatsApp shortens the quote path.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-def\">Определение</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-channels\">Каналы</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-vs\">Vs традиционный</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-start\">С чего начать</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>Цифровой маркетинг</li><li>SEO</li><li>SMM</li><li>CRO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Цифровой маркетинг — доступ к нужной аудитории онлайн — site, search, social, ads and email — to build awareness, trust and sales. At <a href=\"/pages/about\">Bizdavar Group</a> it is not “posting”; it is funnel, measurement and <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">digital marketing services</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/network-map.svg\" alt=\"Map of digital marketing channels for a B2B company\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Every channel should end in a call or quote — not vanity traffic.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-def\">A working definition</h2><p>If a campaign brings visits but WhatsApp stays quiet, marketing is incomplete. We measure cost per lead and conversion, not likes.</p><h2 id=\"ch-channels\">Main channels</h2><ul><li><strong>SEO and content</strong> — including this blog cluster.</li><li><strong>Search ads</strong> — controlled spend on buyer-intent queries.</li><li><strong>SMM</strong> — see the <a href=\"/pages/articles/social-media-management\">SMM guide</a>.</li><li><strong>Website</strong> — start fast with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</li></ul><h2 id=\"ch-vs\">Vs traditional</h2><p>You can move budget weekly. Technical primer: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SEO Starter Guide</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-start\">Where to start</h2><ol><li>One clear service page with WhatsApp/form.</li><li>Two or three cluster articles linking to it.</li><li>Test ads only after conversion tracking.</li></ol><p>Next: <a href=\"/pages/articles/digital-marketing\">how digital marketing increases sales</a> or <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Это только Instagram?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Нет. Сайт, SEO, реклама, email и SMM вместе собирают воронку.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Нужно ли B2B промышленности?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Да. Закупщик тоже ищет; страница продукта и WhatsApp ускоряют запрос.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-def\">التعريف</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-channels\">القنوات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-vs\">مقابل التقليدي</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-start\">من أين تبدأ</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>تسويق رقمي</li><li>سيو</li><li>SMM</li><li>CRO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>التسويق الرقمي هو الوصول للجمهور المناسب عبر الإنترنت — site, search, social, ads and email — to build awareness, trust and sales. At <a href=\"/pages/about\">Bizdavar Group</a> it is not “posting”; it is funnel, measurement and <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">digital marketing services</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/network-map.svg\" alt=\"Map of digital marketing channels for a B2B company\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Every channel should end in a call or quote — not vanity traffic.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-def\">A working definition</h2><p>If a campaign brings visits but WhatsApp stays quiet, marketing is incomplete. We measure cost per lead and conversion, not likes.</p><h2 id=\"ch-channels\">Main channels</h2><ul><li><strong>SEO and content</strong> — including this blog cluster.</li><li><strong>Search ads</strong> — controlled spend on buyer-intent queries.</li><li><strong>SMM</strong> — see the <a href=\"/pages/articles/social-media-management\">SMM guide</a>.</li><li><strong>Website</strong> — start fast with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</li></ul><h2 id=\"ch-vs\">Vs traditional</h2><p>You can move budget weekly. Technical primer: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SEO Starter Guide</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-start\">Where to start</h2><ol><li>One clear service page with WhatsApp/form.</li><li>Two or three cluster articles linking to it.</li><li>Test ads only after conversion tracking.</li></ol><p>Next: <a href=\"/pages/articles/digital-marketing\">how digital marketing increases sales</a> or <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل التسويق الرقمي إنستغرام فقط؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">لا. الموقع وSEO والإعلانات والبريد وSMM معاً يبنون مسار البيع.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل تحتاجه الصناعة B2B؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">نعم. المشتري يبحث أيضاً؛ صفحة المنتج وواتساب تختصر الاستعلام.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"digital-marketing":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-funnel\">قیف فروش</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-cro\">نرخ تبدیل</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">تبلیغات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-follow\">پیگیری</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>CRO</li><li>فروش آنلاین</li><li>تبلیغات</li><li>لندینگ</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>بازدید به‌تنهایی فروش نیست. افزایش فروش یعنی رساندن فرد مناسب به پیشنهاد واضح و بستن مسیر تماس. بیزدوار این مسیر را با داده و تست روی <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">کمپین و CRO</a> جلو می‌برد.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-dm-visual.svg\" alt=\"نمودار قیف فروش دیجیتال از آگاهی تا خرید\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>هر مرحله قیف باید CTA مخصوص خود را داشته باشد.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-funnel\">قیف فروش شفاف</h2>\n<p>آگاهی (مقاله و سئو)، بررسی (صفحه خدمت و نمونه‌کار)، تصمیم (پیش‌فاکتور یا دمو)، خرید (واتساپ و قرارداد). اگر مقاله به <a href=\"/pages/blog\">وبلاگ</a> ختم شود و دکمه استعلام نباشد، قیف قطع است.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-cro\">بهینه‌سازی نرخ تبدیل</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>سرعت و موبایل — به‌خصوص RTL فارسی.</li>\n<li>فرم کوتاه + واتساپ در هدر.</li>\n<li>اعتماد: <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">نمونه‌کار</a> و مسیر شفاف قیمت.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>لندینگ ضعیف را قبل از تبلیغ با <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> عوض کنید.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-ads\">تبلیغات هدفمند</h2>\n<p>گوگل و Paid Social فقط وقتی معنا دارند که صفحه فرود همان وعده تبلیغ را بدهد. بودجه را هفتگی بر اساس هزینه هر لید واقعی تنظیم کنید نه فقط کلیک.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-follow\">اتوماسیون و پیگیری</h2>\n<p>لید بدون پاسخ در ۲۴ ساعت می‌میرد. CRM ساده، یادآوری و ریتارگتینگ هزینه جذب را پایین می‌آورد. شروع از <a href=\"/pages/contact\">تماس بیزدوار</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>اول سایت را درست کنیم یا تبلیغ بزنیم؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">اول لندینگ سریع و فرم/واتساپ؛ بعد بودجه تبلیغ. در غیر این صورت کلیک هدر می‌رود.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>گزارش ROI را چطور می‌بینیم؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">منبع لید، نرخ پاسخ واتساپ و فروش بسته شده — نه فقط بازدید صفحه.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-funnel\">Huni</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-cro\">Dönüşüm</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">Reklam</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-follow\">Takip</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>CRO</li><li>Online satış</li><li>Reklam</li><li>Landing</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Trafik satış değildir. Büyüme doğru kişi, net teklif ve kapalı iletişim yoludur — <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">kampanya ve CRO</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-dm-visual.svg\" alt=\"Farkındalıktan satın almaya dijital satış hunisi\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Hununun her adımının kendi CTA’sı olmalı.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-funnel\">Net huni</h2><p>Makalede teklif butonu yoksa huni kopar. <a href=\"/pages/blog\">Blog</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-cro\">CRO</h2><ul><li>Hız ve mobil, Farsça RTL.</li><li>Kısa form + WhatsApp.</li><li><a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portföy</a> ile güven.</li></ul><p>Zayıf landing’i reklamdan önce <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> ile düzeltin.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Hedefli reklam</h2><p>Landing, reklam vaadiyle aynı olmalı. Gerçek lead maliyetine bakın.</p><h2 id=\"ch-follow\">Takip</h2><p>24 saatte yanıtsız lead ölür. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">İletişim</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Önce site mi reklam mı?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Önce hızlı landing ve form/WhatsApp; sonra reklam bütçesi.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>ROI nasıl bakılır?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Lead kaynağı, WhatsApp yanıt oranı ve kapanan satış — sadece trafik değil.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-funnel\">Funnel</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-cro\">CRO</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">Ads</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-follow\">Follow-up</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>CRO</li><li>Online sales</li><li>Ads</li><li>Landing</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Traffic is not sales. Growth means the right person, a clear offer and a closed contact path — via <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">campaigns and CRO</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-dm-visual.svg\" alt=\"Digital sales funnel from awareness to purchase\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Each funnel stage needs its own CTA.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-funnel\">Clear funnel</h2><p>Awareness, evaluation, decision, purchase. If an article has no quote button, the funnel breaks. See the <a href=\"/pages/blog\">blog hub</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-cro\">CRO</h2><ul><li>Speed and mobile, including Persian RTL.</li><li>Short form plus header WhatsApp.</li><li>Trust via <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">portfolio</a>.</li></ul><p>Fix weak landings with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> before ads.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Targeted ads</h2><p>The landing must match the ad promise. Optimise cost per real lead, not clicks.</p><h2 id=\"ch-follow\">Follow-up</h2><p>Leads die in 24 hours without a reply. Start at <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Bizdavar contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Fix the site or run ads first?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">First a fast landing plus form/WhatsApp; then ad spend.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>How do we see ROI?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Lead source, WhatsApp reply rate and closed sales — not traffic alone.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-funnel\">Воронка</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-cro\">CRO</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">Реклама</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-follow\">Сопровождение</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>CRO</li><li>Онлайн-продажи</li><li>Реклама</li><li>Лендинг</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Трафик — это не продажи. Growth means the right person, a clear offer and a closed contact path — via <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">campaigns and CRO</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-dm-visual.svg\" alt=\"Digital sales funnel from awareness to purchase\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Each funnel stage needs its own CTA.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-funnel\">Clear funnel</h2><p>Awareness, evaluation, decision, purchase. If an article has no quote button, the funnel breaks. See the <a href=\"/pages/blog\">blog hub</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-cro\">CRO</h2><ul><li>Speed and mobile, including Persian RTL.</li><li>Short form plus header WhatsApp.</li><li>Trust via <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">portfolio</a>.</li></ul><p>Fix weak landings with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> before ads.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Targeted ads</h2><p>The landing must match the ad promise. Optimise cost per real lead, not clicks.</p><h2 id=\"ch-follow\">Follow-up</h2><p>Leads die in 24 hours without a reply. Start at <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Bizdavar contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Сначала сайт или реклама?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Сначала быстрый лендинг и WhatsApp; потом бюджет.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Как считать ROI?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Источник лида, ответ в WhatsApp и закрытые сделки.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-funnel\">القمع</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-cro\">التحويل</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">الإعلانات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-follow\">المتابعة</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>CRO</li><li>مبيعات أونلاين</li><li>إعلانات</li><li>صفحة هبوط</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>الزيارات ليست مبيعات. Growth means the right person, a clear offer and a closed contact path — via <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">campaigns and CRO</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-dm-visual.svg\" alt=\"Digital sales funnel from awareness to purchase\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Each funnel stage needs its own CTA.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-funnel\">Clear funnel</h2><p>Awareness, evaluation, decision, purchase. If an article has no quote button, the funnel breaks. See the <a href=\"/pages/blog\">blog hub</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-cro\">CRO</h2><ul><li>Speed and mobile, including Persian RTL.</li><li>Short form plus header WhatsApp.</li><li>Trust via <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">portfolio</a>.</li></ul><p>Fix weak landings with <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> before ads.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Targeted ads</h2><p>The landing must match the ad promise. Optimise cost per real lead, not clicks.</p><h2 id=\"ch-follow\">Follow-up</h2><p>Leads die in 24 hours without a reply. Start at <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Bizdavar contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>الموقع أولاً أم الإعلان؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">أولاً صفحة سريعة وواتساب؛ ثم ميزانية الإعلان.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>كيف نرى العائد؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">مصدر العميل ونسبة الرد والمبيعات المغلقة — لا الزيارات وحدها.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"social-media-management":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-plan\">استراتژی محتوا</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-design\">طراحی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">تبلیغات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>SMM</li><li>اینستاگرام</li><li>لینکدین</li><li>محتوای B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>SMM برنامه‌ریزی محتوا، طراحی، انتشار و تحلیل است — نه فقط «ادمین بودن». برای برند صنعتی، لحن فنی و اثبات پروژه مهم‌تر از ترند صرف است. نمونه آرشیو: <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">بیزتجارت</a>.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-smm-mockup.svg\" alt=\"نمونه مدیریت شبکه‌های اجتماعی و تقویم محتوا\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>تقویم انتشار باید به صفحه خدمت یا استعلام وصل شود.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-plan\">استراتژی محتوا</h2>\n<p>ستون‌ها را ثابت کنید: آموزش، محصول، اجتماعی‌اثبات، استخدام/فرهنگ. برای B2B لینکدین و واتساپ اغلب از اینستاگرامِ صرف جلوترند. اتصال به <a href=\"/pages/services#smm\">خدمات SMM بیزدوار</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-design\">طراحی و ویدئو</h2>\n<p>هویت رنگ، قالب پست و زیرنویس فارسی/ترکی یکدست. ریلز بدون زیرنویس در موبایل دیده نمی‌شود.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-ads\">تبلیغات Paid Social</h2>\n<p>هدف را روی لید بگذارید نه فقط بازدید. لندینگ باید همان محصول تبلیغ‌شده باشد — در غیر این صورت فرمول SMM به فروش نمی‌رسد. مشاوره: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">فرم تماس</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>چند پست در هفته کافی است؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">ثبات مهم‌تر از تعداد است؛ برای B2B معمولاً ۳ تا ۵ انتشار هدفمند بهتر از روزانهٔ بی‌برنامه است.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>نمونه کار SMM بیزدوار کجاست؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">پروژه آرشیو <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">بیزتجارت</a> مدل محتوای صنعتی را نشان می‌دهد.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-plan\">İçerik stratejisi</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-design\">Tasarım</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">Reklam</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>SMM</li><li>Instagram</li><li>LinkedIn</li><li>B2B içerik</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>SMM plan, tasarım, yayın ve analitiktir. Endüstriyel marka kanıt ister. Örnek: <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-smm-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Sosyal medya yönetimi ve içerik takvimi\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Takvim hizmet sayfasına veya teklife bağlanmalı.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-plan\">İçerik stratejisi</h2><p>Eğitim, ürün, kanıt. B2B’de LinkedIn ve WhatsApp sık öndedir. <a href=\"/pages/services#smm\">SMM hizmeti</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-design\">Tasarım</h2><p>Şablon tutarlılığı; Reels’e altyazı.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Paid social</h2><p>Lead’e optimize edin. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">İletişim</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Haftada kaç gönderi?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Süreklilik sayıdan önemli; B2B’de 3–5 hedefli yayın plansız günlük paylaşımı yener.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>SMM örneği nerede?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\"><a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a> arşivi endüstriyel içerik modelini gösterir.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-plan\">Content strategy</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-design\">Design</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">Ads</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>SMM</li><li>Instagram</li><li>LinkedIn</li><li>B2B content</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>SMM is planning, design, publishing and analytics. Industrial brands need technical proof, not only trends. Archive sample: <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-smm-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Social media management mockup and content calendar\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The calendar should link to a service page or quote.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-plan\">Content strategy</h2><p>Fix pillars: education, product, social proof. LinkedIn and WhatsApp often outperform Instagram-only for B2B. <a href=\"/pages/services#smm\">Bizdavar SMM</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-design\">Design and video</h2><p>Consistent templates; Reels need captions on mute.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Paid social</h2><p>Optimise for leads. Landing must match the product. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>How many posts per week?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Consistency beats volume; for B2B, 3–5 targeted posts beat unplanned daily posting.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Where is an SMM sample?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">The archived <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a> project shows industrial content.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-plan\">Контент</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-design\">Дизайн</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">Реклама</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>SMM</li><li>Instagram</li><li>LinkedIn</li><li>B2B-контент</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>SMM — это план, design, publishing and analytics. Industrial brands need technical proof, not only trends. Archive sample: <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-smm-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Social media management mockup and content calendar\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The calendar should link to a service page or quote.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-plan\">Content strategy</h2><p>Fix pillars: education, product, social proof. LinkedIn and WhatsApp often outperform Instagram-only for B2B. <a href=\"/pages/services#smm\">Bizdavar SMM</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-design\">Design and video</h2><p>Consistent templates; Reels need captions on mute.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Paid social</h2><p>Optimise for leads. Landing must match the product. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Сколько постов в неделю?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Стабильность важнее числа; для B2B 3–5 целевых публикаций лучше хаоса.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Где пример SMM?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Архив <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a> показывает промышленный контент.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-plan\">استراتيجية المحتوى</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-design\">التصميم</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-ads\">الإعلانات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>SMM</li><li>إنستغرام</li><li>لينكدإن</li><li>محتوى B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>SMM هو التخطيط, design, publishing and analytics. Industrial brands need technical proof, not only trends. Archive sample: <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-smm-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Social media management mockup and content calendar\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The calendar should link to a service page or quote.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-plan\">Content strategy</h2><p>Fix pillars: education, product, social proof. LinkedIn and WhatsApp often outperform Instagram-only for B2B. <a href=\"/pages/services#smm\">Bizdavar SMM</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-design\">Design and video</h2><p>Consistent templates; Reels need captions on mute.</p><h2 id=\"ch-ads\">Paid social</h2><p>Optimise for leads. Landing must match the product. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>كم منشوراً أسبوعياً؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">الثبات أهم من العدد؛ في B2B يكفي ٣–٥ نشرات موجّهة.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>أين نموذج SMM؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">مشروع <a href=\"/pages/biztejarat\">Biztejarat</a> المؤرشف يعرض محتوى صناعياً.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"fast-studio":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-base\">پلن پایه</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-shop\">فروشگاهی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-pro\">حرفه‌ای</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-after\">بعد از تحویل</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>Fast Studio</li><li>RTL</li><li>ووکامرس</li><li>سئو پایه</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> محصول بیزدوار برای تحویل سایت شرکتی یا فروشگاهی در ۵ روز کاری است — پلن‌های ۹۹، ۱۹۹ و ۲۹۹ دلار با RTL و سئو پایه.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/related-thumb-fast.svg\" alt=\"Fast Web Studio — طراحی سایت شرکتی در پنج روز\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>تحویل سریع وقتی معنا دارد که ساختار URL و فرم تماس از روز اول درست باشد.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-base\">پلن پایه ($99)</h2>\n<p>معرفی شرکت، تماس، واتساپ و موبایل‌فرست. مناسب استارتاپ و برندی که باید سریع آنلاین شود.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-shop\">پلن فروشگاهی ($199)</h2>\n<p>ووکامرس، محصول و درگاه. موجودی و عکس را از قبل آماده کنید تا ۵ روز قفل بماند.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-pro\">پلن حرفه‌ای ($299)</h2>\n<p>صفحات بیشتر، سئو پایه قوی‌تر و آمادگی اتصال به کمپین <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">بازاریابی</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-after\">بعد از تحویل</h2>\n<p>آموزش پنل، پشتیبانی و مسیر ارتقا به پروژه سفارشی در <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">طراحی وب</a>. سفارش از <a href=\"/pages/contact\">تماس</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>۵ روز شامل محتوا هم می‌شود؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">ساختار، قالب RTL و صفحات توافق‌شده؛ متن و عکس را شما یا تیم محتوا می‌دهد تا زمان‌بندی قفل بماند.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>سئو کامل در پلن ۹۹ هست؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">سئو پایه (عنوان، توضیحات، سرعت، موبایل). سئو محتوا و لینک‌سازی جداگانه در <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">خدمات بازاریابی</a> است.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-base\">Temel plan</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-shop\">Mağaza</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-pro\">Pro</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-after\">Teslim sonrası</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>Fast Studio</li><li>RTL</li><li>WooCommerce</li><li>SEO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> 5 iş gününde kurumsal veya mağaza sitesi teslim eder — $99 / $199 / $299, RTL ve temel SEO.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/related-thumb-fast.svg\" alt=\"Fast Web Studio — beş günde kurumsal site\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>URL ve iletişim formu ilk günden doğru olmalı.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-base\">Temel ($99)</h2><p>Tanıtım, iletişim, WhatsApp.</p><h2 id=\"ch-shop\">Mağaza ($199)</h2><p>WooCommerce. Fotoğrafları önceden hazırlayın.</p><h2 id=\"ch-pro\">Pro ($299)</h2><p>Daha fazla sayfa ve <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">pazarlama</a> hazırlığı.</p><h2 id=\"ch-after\">Teslim sonrası</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">Web tasarım</a> ile yükseltme. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Sipariş</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>5 güne içerik dahil mi?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Yapı, RTL şablon ve kararlaştırılan sayfalar; metin/görseli siz veya içerik ekibi verir.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>$99’da tam SEO var mı?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Temel SEO. İçerik ve backlink <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">pazarlama hizmetinde</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-base\">Basic</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-shop\">Shop</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-pro\">Pro</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-after\">After delivery</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>Fast Studio</li><li>RTL</li><li>WooCommerce</li><li>SEO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> delivers a company or shop site in 5 working days — $99 / $199 / $299 with RTL and baseline SEO.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/related-thumb-fast.svg\" alt=\"Fast Web Studio company website delivered in five days\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Fast delivery only works if URLs and the contact form are correct from day one.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-base\">Basic ($99)</h2><p>Company intro, contact, WhatsApp, mobile-first.</p><h2 id=\"ch-shop\">Shop ($199)</h2><p>WooCommerce and checkout. Prepare photos before the clock starts.</p><h2 id=\"ch-pro\">Pro ($299)</h2><p>More pages and readiness for <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">marketing</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-after\">After delivery</h2><p>Panel training and upgrade path via <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">web design</a>. Order: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Does 5 days include copy?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Structure, RTL theme and agreed pages; you (or content team) supply text and photos.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Is full SEO in the $99 plan?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Baseline SEO only. Content SEO sits in <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">marketing services</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-base\">Базовый</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-shop\">Магазин</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-pro\">Pro</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-after\">После сдачи</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>Fast Studio</li><li>RTL</li><li>WooCommerce</li><li>SEO</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> сдаёт корпоративный или магазинный сайт за 5 рабочих дней — $99 / $199 / $299 with RTL and baseline SEO.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/related-thumb-fast.svg\" alt=\"Fast Web Studio company website delivered in five days\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Fast delivery only works if URLs and the contact form are correct from day one.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-base\">Basic ($99)</h2><p>Company intro, contact, WhatsApp, mobile-first.</p><h2 id=\"ch-shop\">Shop ($199)</h2><p>WooCommerce and checkout. Prepare photos before the clock starts.</p><h2 id=\"ch-pro\">Pro ($299)</h2><p>More pages and readiness for <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">marketing</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-after\">After delivery</h2><p>Panel training and upgrade path via <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">web design</a>. Order: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Тексты входят в 5 дней?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Каркас, RTL и согласованные страницы; тексты и фото даёте вы.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Полное SEO в $99?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Только база. Контент-SEO — в <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">маркетинге</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-base\">الأساسي</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-shop\">المتجر</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-pro\">الاحترافي</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-after\">بعد التسليم</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>Fast Studio</li><li>RTL</li><li>ووكومرس</li><li>سيو</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> يسلّم موقع شركة أو متجر خلال ٥ أيام عمل — $99 / $199 / $299 with RTL and baseline SEO.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/related-thumb-fast.svg\" alt=\"Fast Web Studio company website delivered in five days\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Fast delivery only works if URLs and the contact form are correct from day one.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-base\">Basic ($99)</h2><p>Company intro, contact, WhatsApp, mobile-first.</p><h2 id=\"ch-shop\">Shop ($199)</h2><p>WooCommerce and checkout. Prepare photos before the clock starts.</p><h2 id=\"ch-pro\">Pro ($299)</h2><p>More pages and readiness for <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">marketing</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-after\">After delivery</h2><p>Panel training and upgrade path via <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">web design</a>. Order: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل النصوص ضمن ٥ أيام؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">الهيكل وقالب RTL والصفحات المتفق عليها؛ النصوص والصور منكم.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل الـSEO الكامل في خطة ٩٩$؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">أساسي فقط. سيو المحتوى ضمن <a href=\"/pages/services#digital-marketing\">خدمات التسويق</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"industrial-sensors":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-type\">نوع اندازه‌گیری</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-safety\">گواهی و ایمنی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-supply\">مسیر تامین</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>VEGA</li><li>ابزار دقیق</li><li>سطح</li><li>فشار</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>انتخاب سنسور سطح، فشار یا نقطه سطح برای نفت، پتروشیمی، آب و غذا کار کاتالوگ‌خوانی تنها نیست: رسانه، دما، اتصال فرآیند و گواهی ایمنی باید یک مدل را مشخص کنند. بیزدوار <a href=\"/pages/vega\">تامین VEGA</a> و در گاز/شعله <a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a> را با پیش‌فاکتور شفاف انجام می‌دهد.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"سنسور سطح رادار VEGA با بدنه زرد در استودیو محصول\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>بدنه و اتصال فرآیند را کامل ببینید — کراپ نزدیک برای انتخاب مدل کافی نیست.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-type\">نوع اندازه‌گیری</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>رادار (VEGAPULS):</strong> سطح بدون تماس؛ مناسب مخزن و مایع/جامد با شرایط سخت.</li>\n<li><strong>فشار (VEGABAR):</strong> فشار فرآیند و گاه سطح هیدرواستاتیک.</li>\n<li><strong>سوئیچ (VEGAPOINT):</strong> نقطه سطح جمع‌وجور برای آلارم و کنترل.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/product-vegapoint-21.png\" alt=\"نصب سنسور نقطه سطح VEGA روی مخزن استیل بهداشتی\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>نصب واقعی روی مخزن — کابل، کلمپ و نشانگر وضعیت را در یک قاب می‌بینید.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>مشخصات فنی را فقط با کاتالوگ سازنده مقایسه کنید؛ منبع رسمی: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vega.com</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-safety\">گواهی و ایمنی</h2>\n<p>محیط Ex، SIL و بهداشت غذا را در اولین پیام استعلام بنویسید. بدون این‌ها کد سفارش دقیق صادر نمی‌شود.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-supply\">مسیر تامین</h2>\n<p>شرح فرآیند → پیشنهاد مدل → پیش‌فاکتور → سفارش و حمل. جزئیات در <a href=\"/pages/products#supply\">خدمات صنعتی</a> و مقاله <a href=\"/pages/articles/vega-supply-iran\">تامین VEGA برای ایران</a>. استعلام: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">تماس</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>رادار برای همه مخزن‌ها مناسب است؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">اغلب بله؛ کف متحرک، فوم و بخار را در استعلام بنویسید تا مدل VEGAPULS درست انتخاب شود.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>اطلاعات فنی را از کجا بگیرم؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">کاتالوگ رسمی <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA</a> و صفحه <a href=\"/pages/vega\">تامین VEGA بیزدوار</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-type\">Ölçüm tipi</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-safety\">Sertifika</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-supply\">Tedarik</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>VEGA</li><li>Enstrümantasyon</li><li>Seviye</li><li>Basınç</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Seviye, basınç veya nokta seviye seçimi katalog yapraklamak değildir. Bizdavar <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> ve gaz/alev için <a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a> tedarik eder.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA radar seviye sensörü sarı gövde stüdyo fotoğrafı\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Gövde ve proses bağlantısının tamamı görünmeli.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-type\">Ölçüm tipi</h2><ul><li><strong>Radar (VEGAPULS)</strong></li><li><strong>Basınç (VEGABAR)</strong></li><li><strong>Şalter (VEGAPOINT)</strong></li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/product-vegapoint-21.png\" alt=\"Hijyenik çelik tankta VEGA nokta seviye montajı\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Kablo, kelepçe ve durum halkası tek karede.</figcaption></figure><p>Resmi veri: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vega.com</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-safety\">Sertifika</h2><p>Ex, SIL ve gıda hijyenini ilk mesajda yazın.</p><h2 id=\"ch-supply\">Tedarik</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/products#supply\">Endüstriyel tedarik</a> · <a href=\"/pages/articles/vega-supply-iran\">İran için VEGA</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact\">İletişim</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Radar her tank için uygun mu?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Çoğunlukla evet; köpük ve buharı teklifte yazın ki VEGAPULS doğru seçilsin.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Teknik bilgi nerede?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Resmi <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA</a> ve <a href=\"/pages/vega\">Bizdavar VEGA</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-type\">Measurement type</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-safety\">Certificates</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-supply\">Supply path</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>VEGA</li><li>Instrumentation</li><li>Level</li><li>Pressure</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Picking level, pressure or point-level sensors is not brochure shopping: media, temperature, process connection and certificates decide the model. Bizdavar supplies <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> and, for gas/flame, <a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a> with a clear proforma.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA radar level sensor yellow housing studio photo\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>See the full body and process connection — a tight crop is not enough to choose a model.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-type\">Measurement type</h2><ul><li><strong>Radar (VEGAPULS)</strong> — non-contact level.</li><li><strong>Pressure (VEGABAR)</strong> — process pressure / hydrostatic level.</li><li><strong>Switch (VEGAPOINT)</strong> — compact point level.</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/product-vegapoint-21.png\" alt=\"VEGA point-level sensors mounted on a hygienic stainless tank\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Real install: cable, clamp and status ring in one frame.</figcaption></figure><p>Official data: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vega.com</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-safety\">Certificates</h2><p>State Ex, SIL and food hygiene in the first message or the order code will be wrong.</p><h2 id=\"ch-supply\">Supply path</h2><p>Process → model → proforma → shipment. See <a href=\"/pages/products#supply\">industrial supply</a> and <a href=\"/pages/articles/vega-supply-iran\">VEGA for Iran projects</a>. Quote: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Is radar right for every tank?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Often yes; mention foam, vapour and agitation so the VEGAPULS model is correct.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Where is technical data?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Official <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA</a> and <a href=\"/pages/vega\">Bizdavar VEGA supply</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-type\">Тип измерения</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-safety\">Сертификаты</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-supply\">Поставка</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>VEGA</li><li>КИП</li><li>Уровень</li><li>Давление</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Выбор датчиков уровня, давления или предельного уровня is not brochure shopping: media, temperature, process connection and certificates decide the model. Bizdavar supplies <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> and, for gas/flame, <a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a> with a clear proforma.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA radar level sensor yellow housing studio photo\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>See the full body and process connection — a tight crop is not enough to choose a model.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-type\">Measurement type</h2><ul><li><strong>Radar (VEGAPULS)</strong> — non-contact level.</li><li><strong>Pressure (VEGABAR)</strong> — process pressure / hydrostatic level.</li><li><strong>Switch (VEGAPOINT)</strong> — compact point level.</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/product-vegapoint-21.png\" alt=\"VEGA point-level sensors mounted on a hygienic stainless tank\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Real install: cable, clamp and status ring in one frame.</figcaption></figure><p>Official data: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vega.com</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-safety\">Certificates</h2><p>State Ex, SIL and food hygiene in the first message or the order code will be wrong.</p><h2 id=\"ch-supply\">Supply path</h2><p>Process → model → proforma → shipment. See <a href=\"/pages/products#supply\">industrial supply</a> and <a href=\"/pages/articles/vega-supply-iran\">VEGA for Iran projects</a>. Quote: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Радар для любого резервуара?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Часто да; укажите пену и пар, чтобы выбрать VEGAPULS.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Где техданные?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Официальный <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA</a> и <a href=\"/pages/vega\">поставка Bizdavar</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-type\">نوع القياس</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-safety\">الشهادات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-supply\">مسار التوريد</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>VEGA</li><li>قياس</li><li>مستوى</li><li>ضغط</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>اختيار حساسات المستوى أو الضغط أو نقطة المستوى is not brochure shopping: media, temperature, process connection and certificates decide the model. Bizdavar supplies <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> and, for gas/flame, <a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a> with a clear proforma.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA radar level sensor yellow housing studio photo\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>See the full body and process connection — a tight crop is not enough to choose a model.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-type\">Measurement type</h2><ul><li><strong>Radar (VEGAPULS)</strong> — non-contact level.</li><li><strong>Pressure (VEGABAR)</strong> — process pressure / hydrostatic level.</li><li><strong>Switch (VEGAPOINT)</strong> — compact point level.</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/product-vegapoint-21.png\" alt=\"VEGA point-level sensors mounted on a hygienic stainless tank\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Real install: cable, clamp and status ring in one frame.</figcaption></figure><p>Official data: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vega.com</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-safety\">Certificates</h2><p>State Ex, SIL and food hygiene in the first message or the order code will be wrong.</p><h2 id=\"ch-supply\">Supply path</h2><p>Process → model → proforma → shipment. See <a href=\"/pages/products#supply\">industrial supply</a> and <a href=\"/pages/articles/vega-supply-iran\">VEGA for Iran projects</a>. Quote: <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل الرادار لكل الخزانات؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">غالباً نعم؛ اذكر الرغوة والبخار لاختيار VEGAPULS الصحيح.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>أين البيانات الفنية؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\"><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA الرسمي</a> و<a href=\"/pages/vega\">توريد بيزدوار</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"about-bizdavar-group":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-who\">چه کسی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-work\">چه کار می‌کنیم</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">چرا بیزدوار</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>بیزدوار</li><li>درباره ما</li><li>۱۱ کشور</li><li>B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>بیزدوار گروپ از سال ۲۰۱۳ با بنیان‌گذاری <strong>ارسان جاهد تبریزی</strong> کار می‌کند — بیش از ۱۰۰ پروژه در ۱۱ کشور. ترکیب خدمات دیجیتال و تامین صنعتی B2B یک نقطه تماس برای کارفرما می‌سازد.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/about-hero.svg\" alt=\"نمای معرفی بیزدوار گروپ — آژانس دیجیتال و تامین صنعتی\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>سه مسیر کار: خدمات، محصولات خودمان، تامین صنعتی.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-who\">چه کسی هستیم</h2>\n<p>شناسنامه کامل در صفحه <a href=\"/pages/about\">درباره ما</a> است. این مقاله همان روایت را برای جستجوی «بیزدوار گروپ چیست» خلاصه می‌کند.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-work\">حوزه‌های فعالیت</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/services\">خدمات دیجیتال</a> و SMM</li>\n<li><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> و طراحی وب</li>\n<li>محصولات اختصاصی مثل <a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a> و <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a></li>\n<li>تامین <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a>، Prosense، Teltonika و برندهای خرده‌فروشی</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gallery/expo-team-imen.jpg\" alt=\"تیم بیزدوار در غرفه نمایشگاه با بنر Bizdavar\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>حضور نمایشگاهی و شبکه B2B — بخشی از اعتبار قابل راستی‌آزمایی.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-why\">چرا بیزدوار</h2>\n<p>یک تیم هم زبان فارسی پروژه ایران را می‌فهمد و هم مسیر تامین و وب چندزبانه را برای ترکیه و بین‌الملل می‌سازد. <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">نمونه‌کارها</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact\">تماس</a></p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>دفتر بیزدوار کجاست؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">حضور عملیاتی در چند شهر از جمله استانبول و تبریز؛ برای پروژه از <a href=\"/pages/contact\">فرم تماس</a> یا واتساپ هماهنگ کنید.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>محصولات خودتان چیست؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">از جمله <a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a>، <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a> و اکوسیستم FXGuard.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-who\">Kim</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-work\">Ne yapıyoruz</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Neden</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>Bizdavar</li><li>Hakkımızda</li><li>11 ülke</li><li>B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Bizdavar Group 2013’ten beri — kurucu <strong>Ersan Jahed Tabrizi</strong>, 11 ülkede 100+ proje.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/about-hero.svg\" alt=\"Bizdavar Group tanıtımı — dijital ajans ve endüstriyel tedarik\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Üç yol: hizmet, kendi ürün, tedarik.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-who\">Kimiz</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/about\">Hakkımızda</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-work\">Ne yapıyoruz</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/services\">Dijital hizmetler</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a> ve <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> tedariki</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gallery/expo-team-imen.jpg\" alt=\"Bizdavar ekibi fuar standında\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Doğrulanabilir B2B ağ.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Neden</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portföy</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact\">İletişim</a></p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Ofis nerede?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">İstanbul ve Tebriz dahil operasyonel varlık; proje için <a href=\"/pages/contact\">iletişim formu</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Kendi ürünleriniz?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\"><a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a>, <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a> ve FXGuard ekosistemi.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-who\">Who</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-work\">What we do</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Why us</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>Bizdavar</li><li>About</li><li>11 countries</li><li>B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Bizdavar Group has worked since 2013, founded by <strong>Ersan Jahed Tabrizi</strong> — 100+ projects in 11 countries. Digital services plus industrial B2B supply in one contact.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/about-hero.svg\" alt=\"Bizdavar Group introduction — digital agency and industrial supply\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Three paths: services, owned products, industrial supply.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-who\">Who we are</h2><p>Full identity: <a href=\"/pages/about\">About</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-work\">What we do</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/services\">Digital services</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a></li><li>Owned products such as <a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a> and <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a></li><li>Supply of <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> and other industrial brands</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gallery/expo-team-imen.jpg\" alt=\"Bizdavar team at an exhibition booth with Bizdavar banner\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Exhibitions and a verifiable B2B network.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Why Bizdavar</h2><p>Persian-speaking delivery for Iran projects and multilingual web/supply for regional work. <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portfolio</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a></p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Where is the office?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Operations include Istanbul and Tabriz; coordinate via the <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact form</a> or WhatsApp.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Owned products?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\"><a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a>, <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a> and the FXGuard ecosystem.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-who\">Кто</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-work\">Что делаем</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Почему</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>Bizdavar</li><li>О нас</li><li>11 стран</li><li>B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Bizdavar Group работает с 2013 года, founded by <strong>Ersan Jahed Tabrizi</strong> — 100+ projects in 11 countries. Digital services plus industrial B2B supply in one contact.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/about-hero.svg\" alt=\"Bizdavar Group introduction — digital agency and industrial supply\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Three paths: services, owned products, industrial supply.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-who\">Who we are</h2><p>Full identity: <a href=\"/pages/about\">About</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-work\">What we do</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/services\">Digital services</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a></li><li>Owned products such as <a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a> and <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a></li><li>Supply of <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> and other industrial brands</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gallery/expo-team-imen.jpg\" alt=\"Bizdavar team at an exhibition booth with Bizdavar banner\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Exhibitions and a verifiable B2B network.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Why Bizdavar</h2><p>Persian-speaking delivery for Iran projects and multilingual web/supply for regional work. <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portfolio</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a></p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Где офис?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Операции включая Стамбул и Тебриз; пишите в <a href=\"/pages/contact\">форму</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Свои продукты?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\"><a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a>, <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a> и экосистема FXGuard.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-who\">من نحن</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-work\">ماذا نفعل</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">لماذا</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>بيزدوار</li><li>من نحن</li><li>١١ دولة</li><li>B2B</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>تعمل Bizdavar Group منذ ٢٠١٣, founded by <strong>Ersan Jahed Tabrizi</strong> — 100+ projects in 11 countries. Digital services plus industrial B2B supply in one contact.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/about-hero.svg\" alt=\"Bizdavar Group introduction — digital agency and industrial supply\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Three paths: services, owned products, industrial supply.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-who\">Who we are</h2><p>Full identity: <a href=\"/pages/about\">About</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-work\">What we do</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/services\">Digital services</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a></li><li>Owned products such as <a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a> and <a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a></li><li>Supply of <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> and other industrial brands</li></ul><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gallery/expo-team-imen.jpg\" alt=\"Bizdavar team at an exhibition booth with Bizdavar banner\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Exhibitions and a verifiable B2B network.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Why Bizdavar</h2><p>Persian-speaking delivery for Iran projects and multilingual web/supply for regional work. <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portfolio</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact</a></p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>أين المكتب؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">عمليات تشمل إسطنبول وتبريز؛ نسّق عبر <a href=\"/pages/contact\">نموذج الاتصال</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>منتجاتكم؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\"><a href=\"/pages/bizpet\">BizPet</a> و<a href=\"/pages/biztab\">BizTab</a> ومنظومة FXGuard.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"vega-supply-iran":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">کانال رسمی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-steps\">از استعلام تا تحویل</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-brands\">برندهای مکمل</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>VEGA</li><li>استعلام قیمت</li><li>لجستیک</li><li>ایران</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>پروژه‌های نفت، پتروشیمی، آب و صنایع غذایی در ایران به سنسور سطح و فشار قابل‌اعتماد نیاز دارند. بیزدوار تامین اصل <a href=\"/pages/vega\">محصولات VEGA</a> را با مشاوره فارسی، کد سفارش دقیق و لجستیک تا محل پروژه پوشش می‌دهد — نه خرید مبهم از بازار خاکستری.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/slides/value-process-safety.jpg\" alt=\"سنسورهای سطح و سوئیچ VEGA در محیط صنعتی تمیز\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>ابزار دقیق باید در شرایط فرآیند دیده شود نه فقط در کراپ تبلیغاتی.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-why\">چرا کانال تامین رسمی؟</h2>\n<p>کالای اصل، پیش‌فاکتور شفاف و هماهنگی گمرک/حمل. مبدأ دقیق در مقاله عمومی نمی‌آید؛ در استعلام خصوصی مشخص می‌شود. همزمان تیم فنی برای هماهنگی پروژه کنار شماست.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-steps\">از استعلام تا تحویل</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>شرح فرآیند، مخزن و شرایط Ex/SIL</li>\n<li>پیشنهاد مدل (VEGAPULS، VEGABAR، VEGAPOINT) و کد سفارش</li>\n<li>پیش‌فاکتور و بازه تحویل</li>\n<li>سفارش، حمل و پشتیبانی نصب</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"نمای کامل سنسور VEGA برای استعلام فنی\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>برای استعلام، عکس پلاک و شرایط مخزن را همراه مدل بفرستید.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>انتخاب مدل: <a href=\"/pages/articles/industrial-sensors\">راهنمای سنسور صنعتی</a>. داده سازنده: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA official</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-brands\">برندهای مکمل</h2>\n<p>گاز و شعله <a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a>، ناوگان <a href=\"/pages/teltonika\">Teltonika</a>، الکتروموتور <a href=\"/pages/gamak\">Gamak</a> — یک نقطه تماس B2B. شروع: <a href=\"/pages/contact?product=VEGA\">استعلام VEGA</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>کد سفارش را خودتان صادر می‌کنید؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">بله. مدل و شرایط فرآیند را می‌فرستید؛ کد سفارش و پیش‌فاکتور شفاف صادر می‌شود.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>مبدأ کالا را در مقاله می‌نویسید؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">خیر. مسیر تامین رسمی و اصل بودن کالا مهم است؛ جزئیات لجستیک در استعلام محرمانه هماهنگ می‌شود.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Resmi kanal</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-steps\">Adımlar</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-brands\">Tamamlayıcı markalar</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>VEGA</li><li>Teklif</li><li>Lojistik</li><li>İran</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>İran’daki proses projeleri güvenilir VEGA seviye/basınç ister. Bizdavar orijinal <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA</a> tedarik eder — gri pazar değil.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/slides/value-process-safety.jpg\" alt=\"Temiz endüstriyel salonda VEGA seviye ve şalter sensörleri\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Cihaz proses bağlamında görülmeli.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Resmi kanal</h2><p>Orijinal mal, şeffaf proforma. Menşei bu sayfada yazılmaz; özel teklifte netleşir.</p><h2 id=\"ch-steps\">Adımlar</h2><ol><li>Proses, tank, Ex/SIL</li><li>Model ve sipariş kodu</li><li>Proforma</li><li>Sevkiyat ve montaj desteği</li></ol><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"Teknik teklif için tam VEGA sensör görünümü\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Etiket fotoğrafı ve tank şartlarını gönderin.</figcaption></figure><p><a href=\"/pages/articles/industrial-sensors\">Seçim rehberi</a> · <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA</a> · <a href=\"/pages/contact?product=VEGA\">Teklif</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-brands\">Tamamlayıcı</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a>, <a href=\"/pages/teltonika\">Teltonika</a>, <a href=\"/pages/gamak\">Gamak</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Sipariş kodunu siz mi kesiyorsunuz?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Evet. Model ve prosesi gönderin; sipariş kodu ve şeffaf proforma çıkar.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Menşei yazıda var mı?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Hayır. Resmi kanal ve orijinallik esas; lojistik teklifte gizlilikle netleşir.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Official channel</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-brands\">Companion brands</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>VEGA</li><li>Quote</li><li>Logistics</li><li>Iran</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Oil, petrochemical, water and food projects in Iran need reliable level and pressure sensors. Bizdavar supplies genuine <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA products</a> with Persian consulting, exact order codes and logistics to site — not the grey market.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/slides/value-process-safety.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA level and switching sensors in a clean industrial hall\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Instrumentation should be shown in process context, not only a cropped ad.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Official channel</h2><p>Genuine goods, a clear proforma and customs/freight coordination. We do not publish the origin country on this page; that stays in the private quote.</p><h2 id=\"ch-steps\">From inquiry to delivery</h2><ol><li>Process, tank, Ex/SIL</li><li>Model (VEGAPULS, VEGABAR, VEGAPOINT) and order code</li><li>Proforma and lead time</li><li>Order, freight, install support</li></ol><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"Full VEGA sensor view for a technical quote\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Send nameplate photos and tank conditions with the model.</figcaption></figure><p>Selection guide: <a href=\"/pages/articles/industrial-sensors\">industrial sensors</a>. OEM: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA official</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-brands\">Companion brands</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a>, <a href=\"/pages/teltonika\">Teltonika</a>, <a href=\"/pages/gamak\">Gamak</a>. Start: <a href=\"/pages/contact?product=VEGA\">VEGA quote</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Do you issue the order code?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Yes. Send the model and process data; we issue the order code and a clear proforma.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Do you publish the origin country?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">No. Official channel and authenticity matter; logistics details stay in the private quote.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Официальный канал</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-steps\">Шаги</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-brands\">Другие бренды</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>VEGA</li><li>Запрос</li><li>Логистика</li><li>Иран</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Нефть, нефтехимия, вода и пищевые проекты в Иране need reliable level and pressure sensors. Bizdavar supplies genuine <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA products</a> with Persian consulting, exact order codes and logistics to site — not the grey market.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/slides/value-process-safety.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA level and switching sensors in a clean industrial hall\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Instrumentation should be shown in process context, not only a cropped ad.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Official channel</h2><p>Genuine goods, a clear proforma and customs/freight coordination. We do not publish the origin country on this page; that stays in the private quote.</p><h2 id=\"ch-steps\">From inquiry to delivery</h2><ol><li>Process, tank, Ex/SIL</li><li>Model (VEGAPULS, VEGABAR, VEGAPOINT) and order code</li><li>Proforma and lead time</li><li>Order, freight, install support</li></ol><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"Full VEGA sensor view for a technical quote\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Send nameplate photos and tank conditions with the model.</figcaption></figure><p>Selection guide: <a href=\"/pages/articles/industrial-sensors\">industrial sensors</a>. OEM: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA official</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-brands\">Companion brands</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a>, <a href=\"/pages/teltonika\">Teltonika</a>, <a href=\"/pages/gamak\">Gamak</a>. Start: <a href=\"/pages/contact?product=VEGA\">VEGA quote</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Вы даёте order code?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Да. Пришлите модель и процесс — код и прозрачная проформа.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Страна происхождения в статье?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Нет. Важен официальный канал; логистика — в конфиденциальном запросе.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">القناة الرسمية</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-steps\">الخطوات</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-brands\">علامات مكمّلة</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>VEGA</li><li>عرض سعر</li><li>لوجستيات</li><li>إيران</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>مشاريع النفط والبتروكيماويات والمياه والغذاء في إيران need reliable level and pressure sensors. Bizdavar supplies genuine <a href=\"/pages/vega\">VEGA products</a> with Persian consulting, exact order codes and logistics to site — not the grey market.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/slides/value-process-safety.jpg\" alt=\"VEGA level and switching sensors in a clean industrial hall\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Instrumentation should be shown in process context, not only a cropped ad.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Official channel</h2><p>Genuine goods, a clear proforma and customs/freight coordination. We do not publish the origin country on this page; that stays in the private quote.</p><h2 id=\"ch-steps\">From inquiry to delivery</h2><ol><li>Process, tank, Ex/SIL</li><li>Model (VEGAPULS, VEGABAR, VEGAPOINT) and order code</li><li>Proforma and lead time</li><li>Order, freight, install support</li></ol><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/vega/blog-industrial-sensors.jpg\" alt=\"Full VEGA sensor view for a technical quote\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Send nameplate photos and tank conditions with the model.</figcaption></figure><p>Selection guide: <a href=\"/pages/articles/industrial-sensors\">industrial sensors</a>. OEM: <a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA official</a>.</p><h2 id=\"ch-brands\">Companion brands</h2><p><a href=\"/pages/prosense\">Prosense</a>, <a href=\"/pages/teltonika\">Teltonika</a>, <a href=\"/pages/gamak\">Gamak</a>. Start: <a href=\"/pages/contact?product=VEGA\">VEGA quote</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل تصدرون رمز الطلب؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">نعم. أرسلوا الموديل وبيانات العملية؛ يصدر الرمز وفاتورة مبدئية واضحة.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل تذكرون بلد المنشأ؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">لا. القناة الرسمية والأصالة هما الأساس؛ تفاصيل الشحن في الاستعلام الخاص.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"},"multilingual-web-iran-turkey":{"fa":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"در این مقاله\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">در این مقاله</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">چرا دو زبان</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-tech\">hreflang و ایندکس</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-trust\">اعتماد محلی</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">سوالات متداول</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"برچسب‌ها\"><li>hreflang</li><li>RTL</li><li>ایران</li><li>ترکیه</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\">\n<p>کسب‌وکاری که هم مشتری فارسی دارد هم ترکی، با یک سایت تک‌زبانه یا ترجمه ماشینی بدون hreflang در گوگل جریمه یا قاطی‌شدن نسخه می‌گیرد. بیزدوار همین الگو را در پروژه‌ها و در <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> پیاده می‌کند.</p>\n<figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-web-mockup.svg\" alt=\"طراحی وبسایت شرکتی چندزبانه روی دسکتاپ\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>نسخه زبان باید URL جدا، hreflang و محتوای واقعی داشته باشد.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"ch-why\">چرا دو زبان (یا بیشتر)</h2>\n<p>اعتماد محلی: شماره واتساپ، جهت RTL، و قیمت/واحد پولی جدا. صفحه خدمت فارسی نباید کپی ترکی با فونت اشتباه باشد.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-tech\">hreflang و ایندکس گوگل</h2>\n<p>هر زبان URL جدا، canonical همان زبان، و تگ‌های hreflang متقابل. مرجع: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google localized versions</a>. خود بیزدوار روی <a href=\"/pages/blog\">وبلاگ</a> همین مدل fa/tr/en/ru/ar را دارد.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ch-trust\">اعتماد محلی</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>نمونه کار منطقه‌ای در <a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">پورتفولیو</a></li>\n<li>تماس دو زبانه از <a href=\"/pages/contact\">صفحه تماس</a></li>\n<li>محتوای خوشه‌ای مثل همین مقاله به‌جای یک صفحه «همه زبان‌ها در یک URL»</li>\n</ul>\n<p>سفارش سایت دو بازاری: <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">طراحی وب</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">سوالات متداول</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>گوگل نسخه فارسی و انگلیسی را قاطی می‌کند؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">اگر hreflang و canonical درست باشد خیر. راهنمای رسمی: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Localized versions</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Fast Studio چندزبانه می‌دهد؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">بله؛ ساختار fa/tr/en در <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a> قابل توافق است.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">منابع و لینک‌های معتبر</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","tr":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"Bu yazıda\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">Bu yazıda</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Neden iki dil</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-tech\">hreflang</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-trust\">Yerel güven</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">SSS</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Etiketler\"><li>hreflang</li><li>RTL</li><li>İran</li><li>Türkiye</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Farsça ve Türkçe müşteriye tek dilli veya hreflang’sız çeviri yetmez. Bizdavar bunu <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>’da kurar.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-web-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Masaüstünde çok dilli kurumsal web sitesi\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Her dilin ayrı URL ve gerçek metni olmalı.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Neden iki dil</h2><p>WhatsApp, RTL, para birimi. Bozuk klon sayfalar güven kırar.</p><h2 id=\"ch-tech\">hreflang</h2><p>Ayrı URL, kanonik, karşılıklı hreflang. <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google localized versions</a>. <a href=\"/pages/blog\">Blog</a> fa/tr/en/ru/ar kullanır.</p><h2 id=\"ch-trust\">Yerel güven</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portföy</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/contact\">İletişim</a></li></ul><p><a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">Web tasarım</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">SSS</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Google dilleri karıştırır mı?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Doğru hreflang ve canonical ile hayır. Resmi rehber: <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Localized versions</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Fast Studio çok dilli mi?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Evet; fa/tr/en yapı <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>’da kararlaştırılır.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Kaynaklar ve resmi bağlantılar</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","en":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">In this article</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Why two languages</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-tech\">hreflang</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-trust\">Local trust</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Tags\"><li>hreflang</li><li>RTL</li><li>Iran</li><li>Turkey</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>A business serving Persian and Turkish customers fails with one language or machine translation without hreflang. Bizdavar ships this pattern in projects and <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-web-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Multilingual corporate website design on a desktop screen\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Each language needs its own URL, hreflang and real copy.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Why two languages</h2><p>Local trust: WhatsApp numbers, RTL, separate currency. Persian service pages must not be broken Turkish clones.</p><h2 id=\"ch-tech\">hreflang and indexing</h2><p>Separate URLs, per-locale canonicals, reciprocal hreflang. See <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google localized versions</a>. This site’s <a href=\"/pages/blog\">blog</a> uses fa/tr/en/ru/ar.</p><h2 id=\"ch-trust\">Local trust</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portfolio</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/contact\">Bilingual contact</a></li><li>Cluster articles instead of one URL for all languages</li></ul><p>Order: <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">web design</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Will Google mix language versions?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Not if hreflang and canonical are correct. See <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Localized versions</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Does Fast Studio ship multilingual?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Yes; fa/tr/en structure can be scoped in <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Sources and official links</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ru":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"В этой статье\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">В этой статье</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">Зачем два языка</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-tech\">hreflang</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-trust\">Доверие</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">FAQ</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"Теги\"><li>hreflang</li><li>RTL</li><li>Иран</li><li>Турция</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>Бизнес с персидскими и турецкими клиентами fails with one language or machine translation without hreflang. Bizdavar ships this pattern in projects and <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-web-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Multilingual corporate website design on a desktop screen\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Each language needs its own URL, hreflang and real copy.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Why two languages</h2><p>Local trust: WhatsApp numbers, RTL, separate currency. Persian service pages must not be broken Turkish clones.</p><h2 id=\"ch-tech\">hreflang and indexing</h2><p>Separate URLs, per-locale canonicals, reciprocal hreflang. See <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google localized versions</a>. This site’s <a href=\"/pages/blog\">blog</a> uses fa/tr/en/ru/ar.</p><h2 id=\"ch-trust\">Local trust</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portfolio</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/contact\">Bilingual contact</a></li><li>Cluster articles instead of one URL for all languages</li></ul><p>Order: <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">web design</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">FAQ</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Google смешает языки?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Нет при правильном hreflang. См. <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Localized versions</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>Fast Studio многоязычный?</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">Да; структура fa/tr/en в <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">Источники и официальные ссылки</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>","ar":"<nav class=\"article-toc\" aria-label=\"في هذا المقال\"><p class=\"article-toc__title\">في هذا المقال</p><ol><li><a href=\"#ch-why\">لماذا لغتان</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-tech\">hreflang</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-trust\">الثقة المحلية</a></li><li><a href=\"#ch-faq\">أسئلة</a></li></ol></nav>\n<ul class=\"article-tags\" aria-label=\"وسوم\"><li>hreflang</li><li>RTL</li><li>إيران</li><li>تركيا</li></ul>\n<div class=\"article-prose\"><p>الأعمال التي تخدم عملاء فارسية وتركية fails with one language or machine translation without hreflang. Bizdavar ships this pattern in projects and <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</p><figure class=\"article__figure\"><img src=\"/assets/images/content/services-web-mockup.svg\" alt=\"Multilingual corporate website design on a desktop screen\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Each language needs its own URL, hreflang and real copy.</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"ch-why\">Why two languages</h2><p>Local trust: WhatsApp numbers, RTL, separate currency. Persian service pages must not be broken Turkish clones.</p><h2 id=\"ch-tech\">hreflang and indexing</h2><p>Separate URLs, per-locale canonicals, reciprocal hreflang. See <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google localized versions</a>. This site’s <a href=\"/pages/blog\">blog</a> uses fa/tr/en/ru/ar.</p><h2 id=\"ch-trust\">Local trust</h2><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/portfolio\">Portfolio</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/contact\">Bilingual contact</a></li><li>Cluster articles instead of one URL for all languages</li></ul><p>Order: <a href=\"/pages/services#web-design\">web design</a>.</p></div>\n<section class=\"article-faq\" id=\"ch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faqHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"faqHeading\">أسئلة شائعة</h2>\n  <details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل يخلط جوجل اللغات؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">لا إذا كان hreflang والكانونيكال صحيحين. راجع <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Localized versions</a>.</div></details><details class=\"article-faq__item\"><summary>هل Fast Studio متعدد اللغات؟</summary><div class=\"article-faq__a\">نعم؛ هيكل fa/tr/en يُحدد في <a href=\"/pages/fast\">Fast Web Studio</a>.</div></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"article-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"sourcesHeading\">\n  <h2 id=\"sourcesHeading\">مصادر وروابط رسمية</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.vega.com/en-ae\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">VEGA — official product information</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/seo-starter-guide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google SEO Starter Guide</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/specialty/international/localized-versions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Google: localized versions (hreflang)</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>"}};
